--- opendir
ok   the root directory opens
--- the root's first two entries
ok   the first entry is .
ok   and it is the root inode
ok   the second entry is ..
ok   and the root's parent is itself
--- dirfd
ok   dirfd names an open descriptor
ok   and it is a directory
ok   and it is the one that was opened
--- opendir refuses what is not a directory
ok   a plain file is refused
ok   and the reason is ENOTDIR
ok   a path that does not exist is refused
--- names of every length
ok   the scratch directory opens
6 entries: . .. a bcdefghijklmnopq cdefghijklmnopqrs ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQR
ok   no entry has a zero i-number
ok   six entries: . .. and the four made here
--- a name that fills the field
ok   the DIRSIZ-character name came back whole
--- a hole in the middle
5 entries: . .. a cdefghijklmnopqrs ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQR
ok   the emptied slot was skipped
ok   one fewer entry
--- telldir and seekdir
ok   seeking back to a marked entry finds it again
--- rewinddir
ok   two walks agree
--- and it is empty again
2 entries: . ..
ok   only . and ..
done
